# Pairs with TypeOK. The GC records a tail one past the entries it actually
# removed, an off-by-one between the trim scan and the floor it publishes. At a
# full stream the recorded tail leaves the offset domain, which only the
# well-typedness check reports.
MODULE: TypeOkTrimRecordsTailPastRemoved
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the trim records a tail one past the entries it removed
PERTURBS: GcTrim

--- FIND
         /\ tail' = t
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: off-by-one tail.
         /\ tail' = t + 1
--- END